  "thag1.27:1.1": "7 dabbaṃ kusaṃ poṭakilaṃ ",
  "thag1.27:1.2": "usīraṃ muñjapabbajaṃ ",
  "thag1.27:1.3": "urasā panudahissāmi ",
  "thag1.27:1.4": "vivekamanubrūhayanti. ",
